SUMMARY:MST: Stony Bald Overlook to Elk Pasture Gap & Back
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nHike opens at 8:00 P.M.\, Friday\,
  June 19\nDistance: 7 miles out and back\nStarting elevation: 3750\nEnding
  elevation: 4235\nLots of up and down between\nPace: 2.0 to 2.5 mph\n\nWe 
 will start at Stony Bald Overlook and hike to Elk Pasture Gap (where there
  is no elk and no pasture\, but it is a gap) at NC state road 151. Then we
 'll take a break in the shade and hike back.This is a delightful late spri
 ng/early summer hike with lush\, verdant vegetation crowding the trail on 
 both sides and a high canopy overhead. It's as good as it gets on the MST.
  Most of the trail\, I am told\, is the original bridal trail now known as
  the Shut In Trail. Along much the trail the original rock support walls a
 re still in place.\n\nLong pants recommended: there's also poison ivy and 
 stinging nettle. This is not a dog friendly hike.\n\nIf I cancel because o
 f rain\, I'll email the cancelation between 7:00 and 7:30 Monday morning.\
 n\n**Release of Liability:**\n\nThe organizer of this trip is a volunteer 
 and not a professional guide. The function of the organizer is only to org
 anize this trip. If you sign up or participate in this event you acknowled
 ge that you freely and voluntarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\,
  illnesses\, and damages arising from\, as a result of\, and associated wi
 th this event. In addition\, you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup 
 Terms of Service: [https://help.meetup.com/hc/en-us/articles/360027447252-
 Terms-of-Service#h_9e385395-a405-4361-8afc-854a4f586c82.](https://help.mee
 tup.com/hc/en-us/articles/360027447252-Terms-of-Service#h_9e385395-a405-43
 61-8afc-854a4f586c82.)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/315275878
 /
